## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Combat Assistant|r 0.3.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Ember, a tiny two-head-tall mascot, pops up on the game screen during a fight and tells you in a speech bubble when Major Resolve, Minor Resolve or Major Brutality is about to run out and when your health falls low, with a little animation. Or pick the Meru-Sawa Style: three hand-lettered countdown tiles for the same buffs.
## Version: 0.3.0
## AddOnVersion: 6
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsCombatAssistant_Data

